# Phase 15 — keeps apps/api/Dockerfile and apps/web/Dockerfile's
# `COPY . .` from ever baking a local secret, VCS history, or stale
# build artifact into an image layer.

.git
.gitignore
.github
.claude

**/node_modules
**/.next
**/dist
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.swc

# Never bake a real .env into an image — every secret is supplied at
# container run time only (see each Dockerfile's own header comment).
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Phase 16 — real pg_dump output (docs/database-backup-recovery.md warns
# this is as sensitive as production DB credentials) and jest/test logs
# have no business in a build context or an image layer.
infra/backups
**/*.log

**/npm-debug.log*
.DS_Store
